# Silver Sable, Mercenary Leader: a creature enchanted by an Aura its controller controls is modified (CR 700.9). Bot1 puts Rancor on its
# Ornithopter on turn 1. On turn 3 Sable's enters trigger puts its counter on Bot2's Ornithopter, so the one modified creature Bot1 controls is
# the enchanted Ornithopter when Sable attacks: the one target, it gains lifelink; Sable herself, unmodified, does not.

[Bot1 Deck]
Silver Sable, Mercenary Leader
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Ornithopter
Rancor
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Rancor.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Silver Sable, Mercenary Leader.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Attack(Silver Sable, Mercenary Leader > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Flying; Lifelink; Trample
Bot1.Battlefield.Silver Sable, Mercenary Leader.Keywords = (absent)
